    <item>
      <title>Decoding Alzheimer&#39;s: Using Algorithms to Predict Cognitive Decline</title>
      <link>https://academic-demo.netlify.app/post/decoding-alzheimers-podcast/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://academic-demo.netlify.app/post/decoding-alzheimers-podcast/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;-istaart-voices-podcast&#34;&gt;🎙️ ISTAART Voices Podcast&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I had the pleasure of joining &lt;strong&gt;Dr. Willette&lt;/strong&gt; on the &lt;strong&gt;ISTAART Voices&lt;/strong&gt; podcast to discuss our work on using algorithms to predict cognitive decline in Alzheimer&amp;rsquo;s disease.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this episode, we explore:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How &lt;strong&gt;machine learning and predictive algorithms&lt;/strong&gt; can identify early markers of cognitive decline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The intersection of &lt;strong&gt;data science and neurodegenerative disease research&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating algorithmic predictions into &lt;strong&gt;clinically meaningful insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future directions for &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven approaches&lt;/strong&gt; in Alzheimer&amp;rsquo;s research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;listen-now&#34;&gt;Listen Now&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;iframe style=&#34;border-radius:12px&#34; src=&#34;https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/44YB4XoIdO1sUOR8ejEqCu?utm_source=generator&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;352&#34; frameBorder=&#34;0&#34; allowfullscreen=&#34;&#34; allow=&#34;autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📎 &lt;a href=&#34;https://open.spotify.com/episode/44YB4XoIdO1sUOR8ejEqCu&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Listen on Spotify&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This episode is part of the &lt;a href=&#34;https://open.spotify.com/show/16aooATozPzDPqS2zxjJmh&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;ISTAART Voices&lt;/a&gt; podcast series by the International Society to Advance Alzheimer&amp;rsquo;s Research and Treatment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
